{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>VRM can be loaded! The ultimate freedom of character!</strong></h2><br>This game can load VRM characters!<br>You can create your own characters using VRoidStudio or downloaded characters from VRoidHub!<br>This allows for the ultimate freedom of character creation!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Not only characters, but also exceptional \u201cbeing there\u201c feeling and MR functions.</strong></h2><br>Of course, it doesn't end with just loading VRM characters and animating them!<br><br>The \u201cragdoll function\u201d that adds colliders and physics to the loaded characters gives you the feeling that the characters are \u201cright there\u201d!<br><br>In addition, Quest3's MR function is also included!<br><br>By combining the ragdoll function with the MR function, you can experience as if the character has descended into your room!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3106000?t=1743733484","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3106000?t=1743733484","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106000/12352ee7f765e8587ca2480e105ed1fa46e13ce7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743733484","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106000/12352ee7f765e8587ca2480e105ed1fa46e13ce7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743733484","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3308820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>VRM can be loaded! The ultimate freedom of character!</strong></h2><br>This game can load VRM characters!<br>You can create your own characters using VRoidStudio or downloaded characters from VRoidHub!<br>This allows for the ultimate freedom of character creation!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong